   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Quantities and accusative",
     "texto": [
      "To buy something, the simplest form is **Θέλω δύο μήλα** (I want two apples). For an amount, use **ένα κιλό** (one kilo) or **μισό κιλό** (half a kilo).",
      "After **θέλω**, the object usually goes in the accusative: **θέλω έναν καφέ**, **θέλω μία σαλάτα**, **θέλω ένα μήλο**. Learn these expressions as whole phrases."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
